# allowed_signers for Contrapunctus attestations (OpenSSH format).
# One line per signer, added with their submission:
#
#   "<signer id>" namespaces="contrapunctus" <keytype> <base64 key>
#
# Example:
#   "Example Foundation" namespaces="contrapunctus" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1...
#
# The signer id must match the `signer:` field in that signer's record.
# The same public key should be published at the URL in `signer_key_published_at`
# so anyone can bind the key to the real organization. No signers yet.
